  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sebougou Onion Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will support 1,005 onion farmers in and around Sebougou, of whom 917 are women, to improve their yields. The grant will also improve the Association&apos;s capacity for storage and marketing of onions.</narrative>
  </description>
